From e127b5260c1e9898147557799d34340a0299dc9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:24:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add the preconditioner of MUMPS

MUMPSPreconditioner (parallel) applies once the factorization of MUMPS,
with the options of MUMPSSolver: exact, or approximate with the block
low-rank compression (BLRTolerance), for instance inside a Krylov
solver. The construction of the solver of MUMPS from its options is
shared by both entries. SparseDirectSolversTest preconditions the
conjugate gradient of MFEM by the exact factorization (one iteration)
and by the block low-rank one; the generic test runs the new entry.
